### Test to see if endpoints work for REST Application

POST http://localhost:7070/v1/openai/evaluate
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

### Evaluate student 1

POST http://localhost:7070/v1/evaluate/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="student1.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../students/student1.md
--WebAppBoundary--